		{"id":"e000000000000001","type":"group","x":580,"y":1060,"width":1220,"height":1120,"color":"6","label":"REPOSITORY STRUCTURE · WHERE CHANGES BELONG"},
		{"id":"a000000000000001","type":"text","text":"# PHILABANTAY V1\n## Project command center\n\n**Current:** Phase 2 · P2-06 Schedule authority is next\n**Verified:** P1-01–P1-07 and P2-01–P2-05\n**Rule:** no packet is complete without recorded technical + product evidence","x":-400,"y":-1320,"width":800,"height":250,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a000000000000002","type":"file","file":"PROJECT-HUB.md","x":520,"y":-1300,"width":420,"height":210,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a000000000000003","type":"text","text":"## Status legend\n\n✅ verified complete\n🔨 active phase\n➡️ exact next packet\n⬜ not started\n🧹 verified with tracked polish debt","x":-940,"y":-1300,"width":420,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b000000000000002","type":"text","text":"## Phase 1 ✅\n### Foundation + identity\n\n**7/7 verified**\n\nRoles, professional verification, employment-aware revocation, direct-write closure, admin boundary, public catalogue, adversarial gate.","x":-1660,"y":-790,"width":520,"height":430,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b000000000000003","type":"text","text":"## Phase 2 🔨\n### Shops + workforce + availability\n\n**5/8 verified**\n\nShop lifecycle/facts, hiring, employment convergence, and provider capabilities are green.\n\n➡️ **Next: P2-06 Schedule authority**","x":-1000,"y":-790,"width":520,"height":430,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b000000000000004","type":"text","text":"## Phase 3 ⬜\n### Booking + live operations\n\n**0/9**\n\nRequest/assign, disruption, check-in, no-show, walk-ins, offline payments, outbox, durable closeout, journey gate.","x":-340,"y":-790,"width":520,"height":430},
		{"id":"b000000000000005","type":"text","text":"## Phase 4 ⬜\n### Trust + insights + experience\n\n**0/9**\n\nMessaging, disputes, ratings, analytics, owner/barber/customer workspaces, settings, experience gate.","x":320,"y":-790,"width":520,"height":430},
		{"id":"b000000000000006","type":"text","text":"## Phase 5 ⬜\n### Production rollout\n\n**0/6**\n\nRuntime jobs, privacy/retention, security and reliability gates, release candidate, pilot rollout.","x":980,"y":-790,"width":520,"height":430},
		{"id":"c000000000000002","type":"text","text":"### P2-01 ✅\n**Shop lifecycle**\n\nOne owner/one shop; draft, publish, suspend; versioned owner commands.","x":-1660,"y":100,"width":720,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c000000000000003","type":"text","text":"### P2-02 ✅\n**Shop facts**\n\nDetails, location pin, hours, closures, services, photos, publish/unpublish.","x":-820,"y":100,"width":720,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c000000000000004","type":"text","text":"### P2-03 ✅\n**Hiring state**\n\nCanonical off/open/full status, openings, note, public hiring projection.","x":20,"y":100,"width":720,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c000000000000005","type":"text","text":"### P2-04 ✅\n**Employment convergence**\n\nApplications, invitations, and join codes become one owner-approved request flow.","x":860,"y":100,"width":720,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c000000000000006","type":"text","text":"### P2-05 ✅\n**Provider capabilities**\n\nOwner-as-provider, qualifications, accepting state, requests, immutable audit.","x":-1660,"y":500,"width":720,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c000000000000007","type":"text","text":"### P2-06 ➡️\n# Schedule authority\n\nOwner-authored shifts; barber change requests; approval applies schedule; conflict-checked exceptions/absence.\n\n**Lead: Sol high · UI: Sonnet high**","x":-820,"y":470,"width":720,"height":340,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c000000000000008","type":"text","text":"### P2-07 ⬜\n**Availability engine**\n\nCombine publication, hours, closures, employment, verification, qualification, shifts, absence, buffers, overlap, and chairs.","x":20,"y":500,"width":720,"height":280},
		{"id":"c000000000000009","type":"text","text":"### P2-08 ⬜\n**Phase-2 race gate**\n\nParallel vacancy/provider/chair claims produce one valid winner and stable conflicts; responsive role journeys pass.","x":860,"y":500,"width":720,"height":280},
		{"id":"d000000000000002","type":"text","text":"## Human roles\n\n👤 Customer\n✂️ Barber\n🏪 Shop owner\n🛡️ Staff admin\n\nNo role or tenant fact is trusted from the browser.","x":-1660,"y":1240,"width":360,"height":470,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"d000000000000003","type":"text","text":"## React web\n`apps/web`\n\nRoutes + pages\n`useBackend()`\nAsync/error states\nResponsive + a11y\nBearer-token client","x":-1160,"y":1240,"width":360,"height":470,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d000000000000004","type":"text","text":"## Shared contract\n`packages/shared`\n\nTypes + DTOs\nZod schemas\nService interfaces\nPure rules\nStable errors","x":-660,"y":1240,"width":360,"height":470,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"d000000000000005","type":"text","text":"## Express API\n`apps/api`\n\nJWT verification\nRole/capability checks\nTenant scope\nValidation\nError mapping\nRPC orchestration","x":-160,"y":1240,"width":360,"height":470,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"d000000000000006","type":"text","text":"## Supabase\n`supabase/`\n\nPostgres + Auth\nConstraints + indexes\nRLS + grants\nVersioned RPCs\nStorage policy\nImmutable events","x":-660,"y":1810,"width":360,"height":290,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d000000000000007","type":"text","text":"### Security invariant\n\nExpress is one boundary.\nPostgres/RLS is the second.\nThe service-role key stays server-only.\nDirect authenticated database probes must fail closed.","x":-1160,"y":1810,"width":360,"height":290,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"e000000000000002","type":"text","text":"## `apps/web`\n\nReact 19 + Vite\nRoutes, pages, components\nAPI adapter\nBrowser/a11y behavior\nCSS and DoodleBoard UI","x":720,"y":1230,"width":430,"height":320,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"e000000000000003","type":"text","text":"## `apps/api`\n\nExpress REST API\nAuth middleware\nProtected routes\nSupabase clients\nAPI + local integration tests","x":1230,"y":1230,"width":430,"height":320,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"e000000000000004","type":"text","text":"## `packages/shared`\n\nCross-layer truth\nTypes, DTOs, schemas\nService contracts\nPure domain rules\nApiBackend client","x":720,"y":1660,"width":430,"height":320,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"e000000000000005","type":"text","text":"## `supabase`\n\nForward migrations\nRLS policies + RPCs\nLocal config + seed\nStorage rules\nNever edit applied migrations","x":1230,"y":1660,"width":430,"height":320,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"e000000000000006","type":"text","text":"## `docs`\n\nObsidian vault\nV1 plans + roadmap\nArchitecture + security\nTesting evidence\nCurrent state + decisions + session log","x":720,"y":2040,"width":940,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"f000000000000002","type":"text","text":"## 1 · Contract + implementation\n\nShared types / DTO / Zod / pure rules\n→ migration + constraints + RLS + RPC\n→ Express + ApiBackend\n→ integrated UI with honest states","x":-1640,"y":2500,"width":620,"height":310,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"f000000000000003","type":"text","text":"## 2 · Automated gate\n\nClean local Supabase reset\nMigration replay + DB lint\nComplete API integration/direct-RLS matrix\nTypecheck + unit tests\nAPI/web production builds\n`git diff --check`","x":-860,"y":2500,"width":600,"height":310,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f000000000000004","type":"text","text":"## 3 · Product gate\n\nAuthenticated role journeys\nStale/replay behavior\nNarrow/mobile viewport\nKeyboard + focus\nScreen reader where required\nReduced motion\nClean console + recovery states","x":-1640,"y":2920,"width":620,"height":310,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f000000000000005","type":"text","text":"## 4 · Evidence update\n\nRoadmap status\nTest catalog\nQA traceability\nCurrent state when changed\nDecision log when policy changed\nAppend-only session log\n\nOnly then mark the packet complete.","x":-860,"y":2920,"width":600,"height":310,"color":"6"},
